        "description": "Erase unwanted objects from your photos with TUTU. Mark an object with a brush, freehand shape, or tap-to-select, then let AI fill the selected area.\n\n• Open a photo from your library or drag in an image.\n• Mark the area to remove with a brush, shape, or tap-to-select.\n• Zoom, undo, and redo to refine your edit.\n• Save the result to Photos.\n\nImage editing runs on your device. No account is required. Try editing for free. TUTU Premium is required to save edited photos to your photo library.\n\nTUTU Premium\n• Monthly subscription: save edited photos to Photos while your monthly subscription is active.\n• Annual subscription: the same photo-saving feature while your annual subscription is active.\n• Lifetime purchase: permanently unlock the same photo-saving feature with one payment.\n\nThe purchase screen shows the current price, billing period, and any eligible free trial before purchase. Monthly and annual subscriptions renew automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the current period ends. Your Apple Account is charged for each renewal. Manage or cancel subscriptions in your Apple Account settings.\n\nTerms of Use (Apple Standard EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://huisang.notion.site/Privacy-Policy-3174c763eda14336852f7cd94efaa514?pvs=4",
